            "value" : "Je naam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your order will be %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je rit wordt %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone and the car seem to be going different ways." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je telefoon en de auto lijken verschillende kanten op te gaan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone reads the chip in your passport or ID card. That shows it’s genuine and gives your name, date of birth and until when it’s valid. We never read or keep your BSN or address." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je telefoon leest de chip in je paspoort of ID-kaart. Dat laat zien dat hij echt is en geeft je naam, geboortedatum en tot wanneer hij geldig is. We lezen of bewaren nooit je BSN of adres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your pickup: your driver waits here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je ophaalpunt: je chauffeur wacht hier"
